Hello {!Contact.FirstName}, 
 
Congratulations and welcome to the Sun Devil family!  By paying your enrollment deposit, you have taken the next step to becoming an official Sun Devil.
 
Now that you’ve confirmed your housing preferences, you can sign up for orientation in My ASU. 

All admitted first-time freshmen are expected to attend orientation. Reservations are taken on a first-come, first-served basis and program dates fill quickly. Once a program has filled, that program date is no longer available and will not appear for reservations. We understand that there are travel limitations for students coming to ASU from out-of-state, your advisor can work with you to setup a remote orientation if you will not be able to attend one of the dates you currently see listed through your myASU (you can find your advisor's contact information by clicking on 'Advising' under the 'My Programs and eAdvisor' box on your myASU).
 
Keep checking your Priority Tasks in My ASU and complete items as soon as possible to enroll at ASU.
 
If you have any questions about the admission process or ASU in general, I'd be happy to help you in any way I can. 

We look forward to seeing you at ASU. 

Go Devils!

Justin Haley
Pacific Northwest Regional Coordinator
